{
  "name": "n-mandel",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts",
  "totalSeconds": 83.421,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "01",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "You cannot predict the lottery.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/01.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.583,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "bd3c1c36b31d"
    },
    {
      "id": "02",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "But there is one way to guarantee you win it.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/02.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.251,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "bd3c1c36b31d"
    },
    {
      "id": "03",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Buy every single combination.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/03.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.801,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "bd3c1c36b31d"
    },
    {
      "id": "04",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "It sounds like a joke, until you do the math.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/04.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.042,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "bd3c1c36b31d"
    },
    {
      "id": "05",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Meet Stefan Mandel, a Romanian economist who treated the lottery not as luck, but as a shopping problem.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/05.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.789,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "bb7550df9ce5"
    },
    {
      "id": "06",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "His rule was simple.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/06.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.724,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "bb7550df9ce5"
    },
    {
      "id": "07",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Count every possible combination.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/07.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.699,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "bb7550df9ce5"
    },
    {
      "id": "08",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Then wait.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/08.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.488,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "bb7550df9ce5"
    },
    {
      "id": "09",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Only play when the jackpot grows to at least three times what it would cost to buy all of them.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/09.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.364,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "bb7550df9ce5"
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Then raise an army of investors, and buy.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/10.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.133,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "bb7550df9ce5"
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Every.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/11.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.51,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "bb7550df9ce5"
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Single.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/12.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.592,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "bb7550df9ce5"
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.4,
      "text": "Ticket.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/13.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.345,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "bb7550df9ce5"
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "He tested it in Romania, and won.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/14.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.927,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "63c14f547b20"
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "Then he scaled it in Australia, where his syndicate won twelve jackpots and around four hundred thousand smaller prizes, until Australia changed its laws specifically to stop him.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/15.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 7.779,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "63c14f547b20"
    },
    {
      "id": "16",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "So in 1992, he found a bigger target.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/16.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.009,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "d5349f068174"
    },
    {
      "id": "17",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Virginia.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/17.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.621,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "d5349f068174"
    },
    {
      "id": "18",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Just six numbers, from one to forty-four.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/18.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.909,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "d5349f068174"
    },
    {
      "id": "19",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "That is seven million, fifty-nine thousand and fifty-two possible combinations, at one dollar each.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/19.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.726,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "d5349f068174"
    },
    {
      "id": "20",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "And the jackpot would climb to twenty-seven million dollars.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/20.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.544,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "d5349f068174"
    },
    {
      "id": "21",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The tickets had been printed over months in a Melbourne warehouse: sixteen workers, thirty computers, twelve printers, funded by twenty-five hundred investors.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/21.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 6.799,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "5c566a63018b"
    },
    {
      "id": "22",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Now came the buying race.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/22.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.932,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "5c566a63018b"
    },
    {
      "id": "23",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Couriers flooded one hundred and twenty-five shops across Virginia.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/23.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.659,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "5c566a63018b"
    },
    {
      "id": "24",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "They had seventy-two hours to process seven million combinations.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/24.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.042,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "5c566a63018b"
    },
    {
      "id": "25",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "And here is the terrifying part.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/25.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.695,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "6ad6997d05bd"
    },
    {
      "id": "26",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.8,
      "text": "They ran out of time.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/26.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.054,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "6ad6997d05bd"
    },
    {
      "id": "27",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Around seven hundred thousand combinations never got bought.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/27.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.628,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "6ad6997d05bd"
    },
    {
      "id": "28",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "After spending millions, it was still a gamble.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/28.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.171,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "6ad6997d05bd"
    },
    {
      "id": "29",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Then the draw came.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/29.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.858,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "a6e05a5ef8c6"
    },
    {
      "id": "30",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.85,
      "text": "The winning ticket was in their pile.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/30.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.727,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "a6e05a5ef8c6"
    },
    {
      "id": "31",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The FBI and the CIA investigated him for fraud.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/31.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.512,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "a6e05a5ef8c6"
    },
    {
      "id": "32",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "They found nothing.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/32.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.103,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "a6e05a5ef8c6"
    },
    {
      "id": "33",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "No law said you could not simply buy the lottery itself.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/33.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.191,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "a6e05a5ef8c6"
    },
    {
      "id": "34",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "So the states wrote new laws to stop anyone from buying every combination.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/34.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.869,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "f980a33a1d7c"
    },
    {
      "id": "35",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Mandel did not beat the odds.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/35.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.428,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "f980a33a1d7c"
    },
    {
      "id": "36",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.8,
      "text": "He deleted them.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/36.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.735,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "f980a33a1d7c"
    },
    {
      "id": "37",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Fourteen jackpots, and not one of them was luck.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/37.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.097,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "f980a33a1d7c"
    },
    {
      "id": "38",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "So tell me.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/38.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.423,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "f980a33a1d7c"
    },
    {
      "id": "39",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "Is that cheating, or is it just math?",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/n-mandel/39.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.662,
      "tempo": 1.15,
      "hash": "f980a33a1d7c"
    }
  ]
}
